# Frontend (`web/`)

## Stack

Next.js 16 App Router · React 19 · Tailwind 4 · GSAP · `@gsap/react` · shadcn-ready primitives (`web/src/components/ui`)

## Patterns

- Default to **Server Components**
- `"use client"` only for GSAP, event handlers, browser APIs
- Compose pages from section components under `web/src/components/landing/`
- Shared marketing copy/data: `web/src/lib/landing-content.ts`
- Class merging: `cn()` from `web/src/lib/utils.ts`
- Keep Next.js version-specific guidance in `web/AGENTS.md` (auto-maintained block)

## GSAP

- Register plugins once; prefer `useGSAP` for cleanup
- Desktop (≥768px): pinned horizontal sections scrub
- Mobile (<768px): native horizontal swipe — do **not** pin
- Magnetic buttons only on `(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)`
- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`

## Routes today

- `/` — landing
- `/signup` — placeholder until auth milestone

## Do not

- Add dashboard/editor routes until auth + portfolio CRUD exist
- Introduce Inter/system fonts or purple SaaS defaults
- Put heavy animation logic inside Server Components
